Kulintang set, agung or low suspended gong used sparingly, baritone electric guitar, fretless electric bass, compact drum kit with kick/snare/floor tom/hi-hat, handclaps, occasional ride bell, short spring reverb on guitar, light tape saturation, close gong microphones, overhead room pair, and restrained bass amplification.

